        },
        {
          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT loka ajoresio ebe, “Anyoikini eoŋ kes,” ebala EJAKAIT ebe, “Abilari koBabulon ekiror ka aatoŋot, okoku ka okoku loka okoku.” ",
